OL,3,ANine fire engines called to Glasgow
OL,4,Acity centre bar fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 40 firefighters were called
OL,7,Fto reports of fire at a bar in central
OL,8,FGlasgow.
OL,10,FThe Scottish Fire and Rescue Service
OL,11,Fsaid it was alerted just after 14:40
OL,12,Fand nine appliances were in attendance
OL,13,Fon Sunday evening.
OL,15,FImages from the scene showed parts of
OL,16,FRenfield Street and West Regent Street
OL,17,Fwere cordoned off, with a number of
OL,18,Ffire crews gathered outside both the
OL,19,FBistro and Maltman bars.
OL,21,FCrews have now left the scene. There
OL,22,Fwere no reports of any casualties.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
